Passo a passo para o time (e no PC do professor)

git clone <repo>
cd <repo>

docker compose up -d --build // para subir o conteiner
docker exec -it node_app npx sequelize-cli db:migrate // iniciar o server

Abrir:

http://localhost:3000

http://localhost:3000/docs (Swagger)
Fluxo: register → login → Authorize (Bearer) → courses (POST/GET).
